#. Description of the plugin
#: event-digest-for-telegram.php
msgid "Posts a weekly preview of upcoming events to a Telegram group, topic or channel: the events of the coming days plus everything newly added to the programme. Uses the events configured in \"Add to Calendar from Custom Fields\"."
msgstr "Postet jede Woche eine Vorschau der anstehenden Termine in eine Telegram-Gruppe, ein Thema oder einen Kanal: die Termine der nächsten Tage und alles, was neu ins Programm gekommen ist. Nutzt die Termine aus „Add to Calendar from Custom Fields“."

#: includes/class-admin.php:16 includes/class-admin.php:110
msgid "Event Digest for Telegram"
msgstr "Event Digest for Telegram"

#: includes/class-admin.php:17
msgid "Telegram Digest"
msgstr "Telegram-Wochenvorschau"

#: includes/class-admin.php:34
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-admin.php:50
msgid "Event Digest for Telegram needs the plugin \"Add to Calendar from Custom Fields\", which provides the events."
msgstr "Event Digest for Telegram braucht das Plugin „Add to Calendar from Custom Fields“, das die Termine liefert."

#: includes/class-admin.php:58 includes/class-admin.php:77
msgid "Not allowed."
msgstr "Nicht erlaubt."

#: includes/class-admin.php:111
msgid "Posts a weekly preview to Telegram: the events of the coming days and everything newly added to the programme. Nothing is posted in weeks without either."
msgstr "Postet jede Woche eine Vorschau in Telegram: die Termine der nächsten Tage und alles, was neu ins Programm gekommen ist. In Wochen ohne beides wird nichts gepostet."

#: includes/class-admin.php:119
msgid "Bot and chat"
msgstr "Bot und Chat"

#: includes/class-admin.php:122
msgid "Bot token"
msgstr "Bot-Token"

#: includes/class-admin.php:125
msgid "Saved. Leave empty to keep it."
msgstr "Gespeichert. Leer lassen, um ihn zu behalten."

#: includes/class-admin.php:127
msgid "Delete token"
msgstr "Token löschen"

#: includes/class-admin.php:129
msgid "Create a bot with <code>@BotFather</code> in Telegram (command <code>/newbot</code>) and paste the token it gives you. Keep the token secret."
msgstr "Lege in Telegram mit <code>@BotFather</code> einen Bot an (Befehl <code>/newbot</code>) und füge den Token ein, den du bekommst. Halte den Token geheim."

#: includes/class-admin.php:133 includes/class-admin.php:298
msgid "Chat ID"
msgstr "Chat-ID"

#: includes/class-admin.php:136
msgid "ID of the group or channel, e.g. -1001234567890. Use \"Find chats\" below to look it up."
msgstr "ID der Gruppe oder des Kanals, z. B. -1001234567890. Mit „Chats finden“ weiter unten kannst du sie nachschlagen."

#: includes/class-admin.php:140
msgid "Topic ID (optional)"
msgstr "Themen-ID (optional)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:143
msgid "For groups with topics: the topic the digest goes to. Empty = the general chat."
msgstr "Für Gruppen mit Themen: das Thema, in das die Vorschau gepostet wird. Leer = allgemeiner Chat."

#: includes/class-admin.php:148
msgid "Schedule"
msgstr "Zeitplan"

#: includes/class-admin.php:151
msgid "Weekly digest"
msgstr "Wochenvorschau"

#: includes/class-admin.php:152
msgid "Post automatically every week"
msgstr "Jede Woche automatisch posten"

#: includes/class-admin.php:155
msgid "Day and time"
msgstr "Tag und Uhrzeit"

#: includes/class-admin.php:166
msgid "In the time zone of the site. WordPress runs scheduled tasks when the site is visited, so on quiet sites the post can be a little late."
msgstr "In der Zeitzone der Website. WordPress führt geplante Aufgaben aus, wenn jemand die Seite besucht. Auf ruhigen Seiten kann der Post deshalb etwas später kommen."

#: includes/class-admin.php:170
msgid "Days ahead"
msgstr "Tage im Voraus"

#: includes/class-admin.php:173
msgid "Events starting within this many days are listed in the first part."
msgstr "Termine, die innerhalb dieser Anzahl von Tagen beginnen, stehen im ersten Teil."

#: includes/class-admin.php:177
msgid "New events"
msgstr "Neue Termine"

#: includes/class-admin.php:178
msgid "Also list events published since the last digest"
msgstr "Auch Termine aufführen, die seit der letzten Vorschau veröffentlicht wurden"

#: includes/class-admin.php:182
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Nachricht"

#: includes/class-admin.php:185
msgid "Link preview"
msgstr "Link-Vorschau"

#: includes/class-admin.php:188
msgid "Above the text"
msgstr "Über dem Text"

#: includes/class-admin.php:189
msgid "Below the text"
msgstr "Unter dem Text"

#: includes/class-admin.php:190
msgid "No preview"
msgstr "Keine Vorschau"

#: includes/class-admin.php:192
msgid "Shows the preview of the next event page with its image, as when you post a link yourself. Image, title and description come from the page (e.g. set by your SEO plugin)."
msgstr "Zeigt die Vorschau der Seite des nächsten Termins mit Bild, wie wenn du selbst einen Link postest. Bild, Titel und Beschreibung kommen von der Seite (z. B. aus deinem SEO-Plugin)."

#: includes/class-admin.php:196
msgid "Intro (optional)"
msgstr "Einleitung (optional)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:200
msgid "Heading for the coming days"
msgstr "Überschrift für die nächsten Tage"

#: includes/class-admin.php:201 includes/class-digest.php:99
msgid "This week"
msgstr "Diese Woche"

#: includes/class-admin.php:204
msgid "Heading for new events"
msgstr "Überschrift für neue Termine"

#: includes/class-admin.php:205 includes/class-digest.php:116
msgid "New in the programme"
msgstr "Neu im Programm"

#: includes/class-admin.php:208
msgid "Programme page"
msgstr "Programmseite"

#: includes/class-admin.php:211
msgid "Linked at the end of every digest."
msgstr "Wird am Ende jeder Vorschau verlinkt."

#: includes/class-admin.php:216
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen speichern"

#: includes/class-admin.php:228
msgid "The preview was posted to the chat."
msgstr "Die Vorschau wurde in den Chat gepostet."

#: includes/class-admin.php:229
msgid "Nothing to post: no events in the coming days and nothing new."
msgstr "Nichts zu posten: keine Termine in den nächsten Tagen und nichts Neues."

#: includes/class-admin.php:247
msgid "Next digest"
msgstr "Nächste Vorschau"

#: includes/class-admin.php:247
msgid "not scheduled (turn on the weekly digest and enter token and chat ID)"
msgstr "nicht geplant (Wochenvorschau einschalten und Token und Chat-ID eintragen)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:248
msgid "Last posted"
msgstr "Zuletzt gepostet"

#: includes/class-admin.php:251
msgid "Last run"
msgstr "Letzter Lauf"

#: includes/class-admin.php:262 includes/class-admin.php:276
msgid "Find chats"
msgstr "Chats finden"

#: includes/class-admin.php:264
msgid "Add the bot to your group (or as administrator to your channel) and allow it to post messages."
msgstr "Füge den Bot zu deiner Gruppe hinzu (oder als Administrator zu deinem Kanal) und erlaube ihm, Nachrichten zu senden."

#: includes/class-admin.php:265
msgid "In a group with topics: open the topic and send <code>/start@YourBotName</code> there. In a channel: post any message."
msgstr "In einer Gruppe mit Themen: Öffne das Thema und schick dort <code>/start@DeinBotName</code>. In einem Kanal: Poste irgendeine Nachricht."

#: includes/class-admin.php:266
msgid "Click the button. The chats and topics the bot has seen in the last 24 hours appear below."
msgstr "Klick auf den Button. Darunter erscheinen die Chats und Themen, die der Bot in den letzten 24 Stunden gesehen hat."

#: includes/class-admin.php:270
msgid "Save the bot token first."
msgstr "Speichere zuerst den Bot-Token."

#. translators: %s: bot username
#: includes/class-admin.php:292
msgid "Bot: @%s"
msgstr "Bot: @%s"

#: includes/class-admin.php:295
msgid "The bot has not seen any chat yet. Follow the steps above and try again."
msgstr "Der Bot hat noch keinen Chat gesehen. Folge den Schritten oben und versuch es noch einmal."

#: includes/class-admin.php:298
msgid "Chat"
msgstr "Chat"

#: includes/class-admin.php:298
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: includes/class-admin.php:298
msgid "Topics (ID: name)"
msgstr "Themen (ID: Name)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:311
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Vorschau"

#: includes/class-admin.php:318
msgid "Right now there would be nothing to post: no events in the coming days and nothing new."
msgstr "Im Moment gäbe es nichts zu posten: keine Termine in den nächsten Tagen und nichts Neues."

#: includes/class-admin.php:321
msgid "This is what the digest would look like if it were posted now:"
msgstr "So sähe die Vorschau aus, wenn sie jetzt gepostet würde:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:341
msgid "Post this preview to the chat now"
msgstr "Diese Vorschau jetzt in den Chat posten"

#: includes/class-admin.php:342
msgid "Goes to the chat and topic above. Does not change the weekly schedule."
msgstr "Geht an den Chat und das Thema oben. Der wöchentliche Zeitplan bleibt unverändert."

#. translators: %s: link to the programme page
#: includes/class-digest.php:129
msgid "Full programme and calendar subscription: %s"
msgstr "Das ganze Programm und das Kalender-Abo: %s"

#. translators: date format for the event date in the message, see https://www.php.net/manual/datetime.format.php
#: includes/class-digest.php:152
msgid "D, F j"
msgstr "D, j. F"

#: includes/class-digest.php:159
msgid "all day"
msgstr "ganztägig"

#. translators: 1: doors time, 2: start time
#: includes/class-digest.php:167
msgid "doors %1$s, start %2$s"
msgstr "Einlass %1$s Uhr, Beginn %2$s Uhr"

#. translators: %s: start time
#: includes/class-digest.php:173
msgid "at %s"
msgstr "%s Uhr"

#: includes/class-scheduler.php:77
msgid "Nothing posted: no events in the coming days and nothing new."
msgstr "Nichts gepostet: keine Termine in den nächsten Tagen und nichts Neues."

#. translators: %s: error message
#: includes/class-scheduler.php:84
msgid "Error: %s"
msgstr "Fehler: %s"

#: includes/class-scheduler.php:90
msgid "Posted."
msgstr "Gepostet."

#: includes/class-settings.php:56
msgid "The bot token does not look valid. It was not saved."
msgstr "Der Bot-Token sieht nicht gültig aus und wurde nicht gespeichert."

#: includes/class-telegram.php:19
msgid "No bot token saved."
msgstr "Kein Bot-Token gespeichert."

#: includes/class-telegram.php:27
msgid "Telegram could not be reached."
msgstr "Telegram war nicht erreichbar."

#. translators: %s: error message from Telegram
#: includes/class-telegram.php:33
msgid "Telegram reports: %s"
msgstr "Telegram meldet: %s"
